# =============================================================================
# CODEOWNERS — review routing
# =============================================================================
# This file defines who owns review of which paths. The repository owner
# (@Outtsett) is the default owner and reviewer for everything; per-area
# entries below allow finer-grained routing as the project grows.
#
# Syntax: <pattern> <owner> [<owner> ...]
# Owners can be GitHub usernames (@user) or team handles (@org/team).
# The LAST matching pattern wins, so order matters.
# Docs: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-security/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
# =============================================================================

